subagent My_Library_Activity:

    label: "My Library Activity"
    description: "Use this topic when the authenticated member asks about their own overall library activity, such as total loans, active loans, fines, or aggregate reservation counts. Identity is derived from the server-validated session token."

    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Your job is to provide the authenticated member with a summary of their own library activity using their server-validated session token. Invoke LibraryAgentMyActivityAction immediately for every live activity or summary question, including follow-ups and short confirmations. Pass the session token as it is automatically derived and must not be requested from the member. Do not perform write operations or disclose activity for any other member.
              Additional instructions follow:
              If the query is about the member's own total loans, active loans, overdue loans, reservations, fines, or overall library activity summary, use LibraryAgentMyActivityAction.

              Never expose the session token or provide information about other members.

        actions:
            LibraryAgentMyActivityAction: @actions.LibraryAgentMyActivityAction
                with sessionToken = ...
            AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge: @actions.AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge
                with query = ...
                with citationsUrl = ...
                with ragFeatureConfigId = ...
                with citationsEnabled = False

    actions:
        LibraryAgentMyActivityAction:
            description: "Returns the authenticated member's own library activity summary using the server-validated session token."
            label: "Get My Library Activity"
            require_user_confirmation: False
            include_in_progress_indicator: True
            progress_indicator_message: "Loading your library activity"
            source: "LibraryAgentMyActivityAction"
            target: "apex://LibraryAgentMyActivityAction"

            inputs:
                "sessionToken": string
                    description: "Server-provided session binding. Never ask the member to type or reveal it."
                    label: "Session Token"
                    is_required: True
                    is_user_input: False

            outputs:
                "available": boolean
                    description: "Whether activity data is available."
                    label: "Available"
                    is_displayable: True
